#: pages/page-mainwp-setup-wizard.php:816
msgid "The MainWP Site Health Monitoring feature integrates with WordPress 5.1's Site Health tool, providing centralized notifications regarding the health status of your child sites. It allows you to choose between being notified for any status changes or only when the health drops below the 'Good' threshold, ensuring you're informed about crucial security and performance metrics."
msgstr "MainWP 网站健康监控功能与 WordPress 5.1 的网站健康工具集成，提供有关子网站健康状况的集中通知。它允许您选择在任何状态更改时收到通知，或仅在健康状况低于“良好”阈值时收到通知，确保您了解关键的安全和性能指标。"

#: pages/page-mainwp-setup-wizard.php:785
msgid "Excessive checking can cause server resource issues. For frequent checks or lots of sites, we recommend the %1$sMainWP Advanced Uptime Monitoring%2$s extension."
msgstr "过度检查可能会导致服务器资源问题。对于需要频繁检查或大量的网站，我们建议使用MainWP%1$s高级正常运行时间监测%2$s扩展。"

#: pages/page-mainwp-setup-wizard.php:779
msgid "The MainWP Basic Uptime Monitoring function periodically sends HTTP requests to your child sites, based on a chosen frequency from every 5 minutes to once daily, to check their operational status. It uses a direct cURL request to obtain an HTTP Header response, alerting you via email if a site fails to return a Status Code 200 (OK). This feature operates independently of third-party services, providing a straightforward and no-cost option for uptime monitoring across all your managed sites. However, it does not diagnose the specific nature of errors leading to site unavailability."
msgstr "MainWP基本正常运行时间监控功能会根据所选频率（从每 5 分钟一次到每天一次）定期向您的子网站发送 HTTP 请求，以检查其运行状态。它使用直接 cURL 请求获取 HTTP 标头响应，如果网站未能返回状态代码 200（OK），则通过电子邮件提醒您。此功能独立于第三方服务运行，为您所有托管网站的正常运行时间监控提供简单且免费的选项。但是，它不会诊断导致网站不可用的错误的具体性质。"

#: pages/page-mainwp-setup-wizard.php:509
msgid "By adding a new client, you streamline site management within MainWP. Assigning sites to clients allows you to group and manage websites according to the clients they belong to for better organization and accessibility."
msgstr "通过添加新客户，您可以简化 MainWP 中的网站管理。将网站分配给客户允许您根据网站所属的客户对其进行分组和管理，以便更好地组织和访问。"

